# [PHASE 2]: NEURAL LINK (Index Integrity)
# Prevent caching of the app entry point to ensure players always have the latest OS version.
/index.html
  Cache-Control: no-cache, no-store, must-revalidate
  Pragma: no-cache
  Expires: 0

# [PHASE 3]: ASSET ACCELERATION
